# livekit-token   → JWT token for joining a meeting room
# Server secrets on Supabase (dashboard / CLI):
#   LIVEKIT_URL, LIVEKIT_API_KEY, LIVEKIT_API_SECRET, LIVEKIT_MAX_PARTICIPANTS
